  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 15.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hyt ys awriten: 'Ne onfoh þu nænigne had on dome; né ne ara ðu for nanum, þæt þu þæt riht ne deme.'</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It is written: “Don’t look (over-)favourably upon any individual, nor give honour to any (in such a way) that justice is not served.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Scriptum est: Non attendas personam hominis in indicio, nec pro aliquo facies, ut a nero denies et iniuste iudices!</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
